    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rare opportunity to purchase and live in an old cut granite stone manor style house surrounded by seven acres of beautiful landscaped gardens and wooded area with seating.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful, well maintained apartment is situated on the first floor of main house above where the old dining hall used to be. It features two good sized double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, en-suite and main bathroom, kitchen and separate living/ dining room. \r\n\r\nOther features include gas fired central heating, period windows and features all intact, with seating in common areas of the house and designated parking spaces.\r\n\r\nThis apartment oozes character and a romantic charm with a real homely feeling. Viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
